2.1. Ownership

“Piso 13” includes its source and compiled code, programs, data files,
story, script, Spanish, Catalan and English dialogue, characters, the
“Residencia Aurora” setting, pixel-art visuals, interface, logos, icons,
sound effects and music.

The original elements created by Jan Lamarca under the name Janiito Studio
are protected by applicable intellectual-property laws.

Third-party content, including certain music, sounds, fonts, libraries,
assets or licensed materials, remains the property of its respective
authors, owners or licensors.

The fact that “Piso 13” is free or non-commercial does not remove or reduce
the rights of third parties.

This repository is not released under an open-source or free-software
license.

2.2. Trademarks, Names and Logos

The names “Piso 13”, “Janiito Studio” and “Jan Lamarca”, together with
their logos, icons and other distinctive signs, are reserved for their
respective owners.

No right or license is granted to use these trademarks, names, logos or
distinctive signs outside the uses permitted by this document.

Files under `/assets/images/` and `/assets/icons/` may contain materials
owned by Jan Lamarca, Janiito Studio or third parties.

2.3. Permitted Use of This Public Repository

This public repository is provided for:

- Technical inspection, personal study and educational reference.
- Observation and verification of the program’s functioning within the
