This permission is personal, limited, non-exclusive and non-transferable.
It does not grant or assign any exploitation rights.

2.4. Restrictions

Without prior written permission from the relevant rights holder, you may
NOT:

- Copy, reproduce, publish, redistribute or make the game, demo, code or
  files available to the public, in whole or in part.
- Host, mirror, re-upload, clone or publish copies of the game on other
  domains, servers, repositories, web portals or digital stores.
- Incorporate the code, files, dialogue, assets or substantial parts of the
  project into another project, product, application, game or software.
- Adapt, transform or create derivative works from the project, except where
  permitted by law or authorized.
- Embed or frame the game through `<iframe>`, `<embed>` or equivalent
  systems on websites outside `janiito.com` and its subdomains
